Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 09:05:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gi): show weapon and artifact sets in team combo DPS

Each member card of the Team Combo DPS shows the weapon (icon, name,
level, refinement) and the active artifact set bonuses (4-set or 2-set,
with the set effects on hover), as the member's build is computed, so
saved and TC builds show what they use too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Asb8vZRqeTYT9zLpVizGNv
